1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,620
Welcome to your sandbox class.

2
00:00:02,620 --> 00:00:04,510
Everything here is practice.

3
00:00:04,510 --> 00:00:07,140
Nothing you do reaches real students.

4
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:10,930
Use Stream to share announcements.

5
00:00:10,930 --> 00:00:14,050
Write a message, post it, and see where it appears.

6
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:19,450
You can remove your own post and try again.

7
00:00:21,450 --> 00:00:24,170
Classwork keeps learning materials organised.

8
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:29,320
Create a topic, then file an assignment beneath it so students can find their work.

9
00:00:34,170 --> 00:00:36,310
Practise managing people here.

10
00:00:37,820 --> 00:00:40,820
A co-teacher invitation appears as Pending,

11
00:00:42,210 --> 00:00:44,930
while this sandbox adds a student as Active.

12
00:00:44,930 --> 00:00:47,540
You can also regenerate the class code.

13
00:00:48,830 --> 00:00:54,530
Need support? Open Practice Help for an explanation, guided steps, or this walkthrough.

14
00:00:57,470 --> 00:01:00,920
Review what you tried and decide what needs more practice.

15
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:02,440
There is no score.

16
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:07,510
Return to any tab, explore in your own order, and reset whenever you want.

17
00:01:07,870 --> 00:01:10,070
Your turn — Begin Practice.
